creature you control attacks, you may put a quest counter on Beastmaster Ascension.\\nAs long as Beastmaster Ascension has seven or more quest counters on it, creatures you control get +5/+5.', "Whenever a player casts a green spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Titania's Chosen.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.', "Whenever another creature you control dies, you get an experience counter.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, choose target creature card in your graveyard. If that card's mana value is less than or equal to the number of experience counters you have, return it to the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your hand.", 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast an Elf spell, you may create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'You draw three cards and you lose 3 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'You may activate abilities of creatures you control as though those creatures had haste.\\n{1}, {T}: Untap target creature.', 'You may choose not to untap Rubinia Soulsinger during your untap step.\\n{T}: Gain control of target creature for as long as you control Rubinia and Rubinia remains tapped.', "Your opponents can't search libraries.\\nIf an opponent would begin an extra turn, that player skips that turn instead.", '[+2]: Create a 1/1 green Elf Druid creature token with "{T}: Add {G}."\\n[−2]: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\\n[−6]: Draw a card for each green creature you control.\\nFreyalise, Llanowar\'s Fury can be your commander.', '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{G}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{U}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{B}.', "{1}{B}{G}: Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains intimidate until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)\\n{2}{B}{G}, Sacrifice a nontoken creature: Create X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens, where X is the sacrificed creature's toughness.", '{1}{G}, Sacrifice Viridian Zealot: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', '{1}{R}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn.\\n{1}{W}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Armillary Sphere: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{2}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.\\n{5}, {T}: Destroy target creature with flying.', '{2}{W}: Target player gains 1 life.\\n{2}{B}: Each player loses 1 life.', "{2}{W}{U}: Exile target creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", '{3}, {T}: Draw three cards. This ability costs {1} more to activate for each card in your hand.', '{3}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice X other creatures: Return X target creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n{5}{B}{B}: Put Champion of Stray Souls on top of your library from your graveyard.', '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{4}{G}, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target creature with flying.', '{G}: Regenerate another target Elf.\\n{2}{G}{G}{G}: Elf creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', "{T}, Exile Surveyor's Scope: Search your library for up to X basic land cards, where X is the number of players who control at least two more lands than you. Put those cards onto the battlefield, then shuffle.", '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Plaguelord: Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.\\nSacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\nMorph {2} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Bant Panorama: Search your library for a basic Forest, Plains, or Island card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. If you spend this mana to cast your commander, it enters the battlefield with a number of additional +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of times it's been cast from the command zone this game.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Molten Slagheap.\\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Molten Slagheap: Add X mana in any combination of {B} and/or {R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Saltcrusted Steppe.\\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Saltcrusted Steppe: Add X mana in any combination of {G} and/or {W}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Haunted Fengraf: Return a creature card at random from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Gargoyle Castle: Create a 3/4 colorless Gargoyle artifact creature token with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Crystal Vein: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Ghost Quarter: Destroy target land. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {G} for each Elf on the battlefield.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {W} or {U}.\\n{W}{U}: Azorius Keyrune becomes a 2/2 white and blue Bird artifact creature with flying until end of turn.', '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each Elf you control.', '{T}: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves on the battlefield.', '{T}: Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}: You gain 1 life for each Elf on the battlefield.', "{W}, Sacrifice Soul Snare: Exile target creature that's attacking you or a planeswalker you control."]
flavor: ['"After death you face paradise, damnation, or Tariel."\\n—Priest\'s teaching', '"An indrik\'s howl has destructive power much subtler than that of its crushing foot. The sound is mundane, but inaudible vibrations scatter and sunder magical contrivances."\\n—Simic research notes', '"As long as I pull the strings, you will dance."\\n—Tezzeret', '"Beauty determines value, and we determine beauty."', '"Better the dead depart utterly than be enslaved."', '"Body and spirit are sworn enemies. They will take any excuse to be rid of each other."\\n—Tariel, Reckoner of Souls', '"Choices belong to those with the luxuries of time and distance. We have neither. I recommend we proceed with the plan to destroy all shrines of the kami."\\n—Lady Azami, letter to Sensei Hisoka', '"Close your ears to the voice of greed, and you can turn a gift for one into a gift for many."', '"Death is no excuse for disobedience."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Did you have a nice nap?"\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Die. But die knowing that your pathetic life will yield a great bounty for me."\\n—Zul Ashur, lich lord', '"Diplomacy has solved nothing. Only bloodspill can end this now. Call forth the warbringer."\\n—Basandra, Battle Seraph', '"Do as I think, not as I do."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"Don\'t worry, your death will be as informative as possible."\\n—Gorghul, augur of skulls', '"Eyeblights are easy to track. Just follow the imperfections."', '"For its time as a mortal, Anger chose a shell of boiling rock."\\n—*Scroll of Beginnings*', '"From a tiny sprout, the greatest trees grow and flourish. May the seeds of your mind be equally fruitful."', '"Give up these unnatural weapons, these scrolls. Heart and mind and fist are enough."\\n—Zyd, Kamahlite druid', '"Gods don\'t die. They merely slumber."\\n—Ayli, Kamsa cleric', '"Have you ever held a Boros signet? There\'s a weight to it that belies its size—a weight of strength and of pride."\\n—Agrus Kos', '"He has been to the heart of the wood. Did you truly expect to wield power over him?"\\n—Oakhide druid', '"Here lies Gond, hero of Safehold Taldwen. May he ever guide our quest."', '"Hold the line, hold the li—"\\n—General Srok, last words', '"Hunters feed on the fear of their prey."\\n—Garruk Wildspeaker', '"I believe many worlds will bow to Phyrexia. Mirrodin is merely the first."\\n—Sheoldred, Whispering One', '"I feel in them a sense of duty and commitment, yet I can feel nothing else. It is as if their duty is to an empty void."\\n—Razia, Boros archangel', '"I love what they\'ve done with the place."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"I prefer loyalty to be a matter of respect, not of magic. But one does what one must."\\n—Kaalia of the Vast', '"I saw the devastation when the juggernauts crashed the walls of An Karras. Then I got to thinking."\\n—Janji, sylvan druid', '"I will fight only the way nature intended—and nature intended us to win."', '"I\'ll have my revenge if I have to call on every force from above and below."', '"I\'ve seen death before. My mother succumbing to illness, my comrades bleeding on the battlefield . . . But I\'d never seen anything as dreadful as that."\\n—Taani, berserker of Etlan', '"In the gathering there is strength for all who founder, renewal for all who languish, love for all who sing."\\n—*Song of All*, canto 642', '"It reflects the purity of Mirrodin-that-was."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"It\'s not the darkness I fear but dull and numbing shades of gray."\\n—Sydri, galvanic genius', '"Justice is toothless without punishment. Righteousness cannot succeed without the suffering of the guilty."\\n—Razia, Boros archangel', '"Knowledge is a stain that only instinct and ferocity can cleanse."\\n—Drarg, wolfcaller', '"Let the rest of Ravnica sneer. One way or another, they all end up in the undercity."\\n—Jarad', '"Life grows everywhere. My kin merely find those places where it grows strongest."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"May all the cairns of Jund be toppled."\\n—Meren of Clan Nel Toth', '"My family protects all families."', '"My skills are wasted here."\\n—Juruk, Kalonian tracker', '"Not all paths are found on the forest floor."', '"Nothing in nature goes to waste, not even the rotting corpse of a good-for-nothing, blood-sucking vampire."\\n—Halana of Ulvenwald', '"Purge the damned, for they have no place among the righteous!"\\n—Seeta of Thraben', '"Ruhan would never agree to such terms."\\n—Ruhan of the Fomori', '"See, the land itself raises an altar to the ascendancy of nature."\\n—Mayael the Anima', '"Take up the quill, and feel your future flow into the runes."', '"The Origin Query will wait. We must ensure we survive to return to it."\\n—Pelyus, vedalken ordinar', '"The awestruck birds gazed at Wonder. Slowly, timidly, they rose into the air."\\n—*Scroll of Beginnings*', '"The beasts of the wild are my senses. It is through their eyes that all knowledge shall come to me."', '"The best experiments are those whose successes replicate themselves."\\n—Yolov, Simic bioengineer', '"The final stage of the illness: delirium, convulsions, and death."\\n—Phyrexian progress notes', '"The higher the mind soars, the greater its understanding of the law."\\n—Isperia', '"The light of beauty protects our journeys through darkness."', '"The more our numbers grow, the more I gain hope that Volrath and his cursed stronghold will one day fall."\\n—Eladamri, Lord of Leaves', '"The scourge of Skyshroud is airborne once more."\\n—Oracle *en*-Vec', '"The shadow travels toward the apex. I predict we will soon see the true measure of darkness."', '"There is great wisdom in rushing headlong into combat . . . if you\'re prepared."\\n—Kenjek, captain of the Thousand Swords', '"They put bars on these noble beasts and then wonder why werewolves target our towns."', '"Time and space are just new battlefields to be mastered."', '"Tomorrow wears yesterday\'s face."\\n—Kordel the Cryptic', '"Truth shines even in darkness. Those who march on the side of truth walk always in righteous light."', '"Until the world unites in vengeful fury and Phage is destroyed, I will not stay my hand."\\n—Akroma, angelic avenger', '"Verdant bloom does exist. It merely hides for its own safety."', '"We are all decaying, always in a state of near-death. One moment without breath and we begin to break down."\\n—Cevraya, Golgari shaman', '"We must all make sacrifices for the good of Innistrad."\\n—Sorin Markov', '"What do a hero and an arrow have in common? In times of war are many more made."\\n—Elvish riddle', '"What was once formed by masons, shaped by smiths, or given life by mages, I will return to the embrace of the earth."', '"When something dies, all things benefit. Well okay, just our things."\\n—Ezoc, Golgari rot farmer', '"When the land is angry, so are they."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"Why do you weep for the dead? I rejoice, for they have died for me."', '"Why listen to the mumblings of wizards when the lash speaks true?"', '"You may enter, but leave those lifeless things of your world behind."\\n—Modruni, maro-sorcerer', 'A demon cannot be trusted, and a dragon will not be ruled.', "A ghoulcaller's playground.", "A scavenger's favorite appetizer is death.", 'After lightning struck the cliffs, the ore became iron, the iron became steel, and the steel became greaves. The lightning never left.', "As the Phyrexian contagion corroded Karn's body, the praetors whispered psalms to corrupt his mind.", "Baby dragons can't figure out humans—if they didn't want to be killed, why were they made of meat and treasure?", "Bant's hearts are as pure as its air and as bright as its skies.", 'By the time the spider comes to slurp up its dinner, its victims have been partially dissolved by acidic silk.', 'Depending on your point of view, the seal represents a proud guardian of the natural cycle or one who has sold her soul to darkness for eternal life.', 'Deserted, but not uninhabited.', 'Each flower identical, every leaf and petal disturbingly exact.', 'Elves of the immaculate class weave flora into living creatures—sometimes to endorse an elite warrior, sometimes to create a breathing work of art.', 'Enter and comprehend the perfection of orchestrated life.', 'Enter and rejoice! The Conclave stands united, open to one and all.', 'Enter the Senate, the seat of justice and the foundation of Ravnican society.', 'Enter those who are starving and sick. You are welcome among the Swarm when the rest of Ravnica rejects you.', "Even through the Mirari's voice, the elves still hear the call of their kinship.", 'Even when the flesh grows cold, knowledge waits in the bones for a master to release it.', 'Every branch a crossroads, every vine a swift steed.', 'Few who encounter the strange, human-like grove leave once the lilting chorus of the dryads reaches their ears.', 'For each creature that arrives in its audience, the sage imparts another piece of ancient wisdom for all to hear.', 'For the Simic Combine, its sigil serves not as an emblem of honor but as a trademark. Its familiar image on any biological commodity attests to superb craftsmanship, ingenious innovation, and higher cost.', "For wisdom's sake, it was built high to gaze on all things. For glory's sake, it was built high as a testament of power. For strength's sake, it was built high to repel all attacks.", "From the highest tiers of Dawn's Light Palace to the deepest shade of Wren's Run, the silver notes of the horn shimmer through the air, and all who hear it feel its pull.", 'Gods can be appeased. Demons, however . . .', "Guarding the ship is the Thornwinds' first concern. Getting along with the locals ranks fourth or fifth at best.", 'He knows the name of every elf born in the last four centuries. More importantly, they all know his.', 'He lurks in the undercity, eager for the corpse haulers to unload their rotting cargo.', 'Her hunger will not be denied.', 'His roots reach deep and grip hard.', 'His verdict is always guilty. His sentence is always death.', "If it can't be had here, it can't be had on any world.", "If you hear it, it's too late.", 'In a culture of beauty, the most beautiful are worshipped as gods.', 'Infinite possibilities contained in a finite space.', 'Infinitely powerless.', 'It claws at the earth in a vain attempt to reclaim what it once was.', 'It gnashed its teeth, and the battlefield filled with the screech of blade striking blade.', 'It harmonizes with the essence of its master.', 'It sees shaped stone and carved wood as mutilations.', "It's there when a seed sprouts, when gourds ripen on the vines, and when the reapers cut the grains under the Harvest Moon.", 'Its wings disturb more than air.', 'Ixidor had only to imagine their ruin and Akroma made it so.', 'Jort the Thunder-Mad spent his life perfecting a way to harness the power of the heavens.', 'Kongming and Lu Su tricked Wei troops into shooting over 100,000 arrows at them to later use against the Wei at Red Cliffs.', 'Left to itself, nature overflows any container, overthrows any restriction, and overreaches any boundary.', "Lost to time is the artificer's art of trapping light from a distant star in a ring of purest gold.", 'Made of bone and boiled in blood, a Rakdos signet is not considered finished until it has been used as a murder weapon.', 'Mages come from far and wide to bathe in its wisdom.', 'Massive, mindless, and imbued with one terrible purpose.', "Most knew of the tower's wizard and gargoyle. Few realized which was guardian and which was master.", "Nature doesn't walk.", 'Necromancers deal in commodities far more precious than gold and grain.', 'No spot in nature is truly barren.', 'Nothing lives within it, yet there is life.', 'Olka collected the evening mist for years, studying its secrets. Once she learned its essence, she could vanish with a thought.', "Once you've been dragged down the currents of time, you'll never quite trust your own permanence again.", 'One bone broken for every twig snapped underfoot.\\n—Llanowar penalty for trespassing', "Paradoxically, to tilt the massive jug for a sip, you'd need the energy of the giant's tonic.", 'Perfect justice in service of a perfect will.', 'Pharika has written her secrets on its bones so that only the worthy may discover them.', 'Rakdos festivals almost leave enough rubble in their wake to hide the bodies.', 'Sentience is its natural habitat.', 'She preaches the blessings of the Machine Orthodoxy.', "She remembers every word spoken, from the hero's oath to the baby's cry.", 'Some timelines forever fray, branch, and intermingle. Others end abruptly.', 'Suddenly, Eldo felt very alone.', "The Keldons used the toxic vents in the cracked earth to bolster their home's defenses.", 'The clicks and buzz of the undercity proclaim him the incarnation of decay.', "The correct answer to a barbarian's riddle is to choke on your cleverness and die.", 'The eyes let flow with tears, then blood, then the very soul—the whole wrung inside out, dripping down into the blackened puddle of the past.', 'The first satyr to wake after a revel must search for the site of the next one.', "The form of the sigil is just as important as the sigil itself. If it's carried on a medallion, its bearer is a master. If it's tattooed on the body, its bearer is a slave.", 'The infamous Ezuri commands the highest bounty the vedalken have ever placed upon an outlaw.', 'The kor send their thopter kites to see if the land is in a welcoming mood.', 'The land knows no difference between the graves of commoners and nobles.', 'The mind is a beautiful bounty encased in an annoying bone container.', 'The mysterious purpose of two of the rings had eluded Esper mages—until now.', 'The nacatl called this new species "vetli," their word for poison arrows.', 'The oni leapt easily from peak to peak, toying with its victims, its voice a purr from the rumbling depths of nightmare.', 'The spires of Ravnica are no different from the tall trees of other planes. The elves navigate and protect them just the same.', 'The symbol of the Conclave is one of unity, with tree supporting sun and sun feeding tree.', 'The travelers were warned to watch out for children on the road.', 'The waters of wisdom are as dust in the mouth of one who thirsts for power.', 'The winds of change have a mind of their own.', 'The wise always keep an ear open to the whispers of power.', 'Their arrows are tipped with basilisk eyes and fletched with cockatrice feathers.', 'There were no tombstones in orochi territory. Slain warriors were buried with a tree sapling, so they would become a part of the forest after death.', 'They are cautious with their body language and facial expressions. Any stray movement could betray the positions of the troops they protect and cost many lives.', 'They fell screaming into the depths of the chasm like so many pebbles tossed down a well.', 'They lament the doom that is coming to Bant without realizing the part their own leaders have played in it.', 'Those who bring nothing to the temple take nothing away.', 'Those who hear its roar perish. The lucky ones only feel its fetid breath.', 'Titania rewards all who honor the forest by making them a living part of it.', 'To the Golgari, anything buried is treasure.', "Unaware of Lorwyn's diversity, it sees only itself, reflected a thousand times over.", 'Urza tried to rule the air, but Gaea taught him that she controlled all the elements.', 'When defeat is near and guidance is scarce, all eyes look in one direction.', "When tempers run high, it's easy to lose your head.", 'Without the interfering hands of civilization, nature will always shape itself to its own needs.']
artist: ['Adam Paquette', 'Adrian Smith', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Allen Williams', 'Andreas Rocha', 'Andrew Goldhawk', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Austin Hsu', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Brom', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chippy', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Craig Mullins', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Frazier', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Daren Bader', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Dorman', 'Dave Kendall', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Donato Giancola', 'Drew Baker', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Fortune', 'Eytan Zana', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Fred Fields', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Hannibal King', 'Heather Hudson', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'Howard Lyon', 'Iain McCaig', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Ironbrush', 'Ittoku', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jasper Sandner', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jeremy Enecio', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Nelson', 'Jim Pavelec', 'John Avon', 'John Matson', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jung Park', 'Junko Taguchi', 'Justin Sweet', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Larry MacDougall', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lindsey Look', 'Liz Danforth', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Marco Nelor', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Matthew Mitchell', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Sass', 'Min Yum', 'Nick Percival', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pat Lee', 'Pat Lewis', 'Paul Bonner', 'Pete Venters', 'Peter Mohrbacher', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Sardinha', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Robbie Trevino', 'Ron Spears', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Song Shikai', 'Stephan Martiniere', 'Stephen Daniele', 'Stephen Tappin', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomas Giorello', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'William Wu', 'Xu Xiaoming', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
